  "default_layout": "isolated_run_tree",
  "default_layout_note": "The workspace and run skeletons are fixed. YAML may select what is generated, but it cannot redirect mutable run output to peer diagnostics or results directories. Imported or generated reusable inputs live in the workspace asset store and are materialized into the run-owned inputs tree.",
  "resolved_safety_history": {
    "note": "The former configurable output/log topology and its unsafe-path override were removed before compatibility guarantees applied. Generated controls now emit the canonical run-local paths last, and staged-control preflight plus the C log cleanup guard remain defense in depth.",
